  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FUF bevakning och granskning Almedalen 2023</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FUF&apos;s independent coverage of Almedalen 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen inneb&#xe4;r oberoende bevakning av svenska bist&#xe5;ndsakt&#xf6;rer och debatten om global utveckling under Almedalsveckan. Sj&#xe4;lva bevakningen p&#xe5; plats kommer att utf&#xf6;ras av en 
redaktion best&#xe5;ende av unga ideellt aktiva personer, samt personer fr&#xe5;n FUF:s kansli.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contribution consists of financing of independent coverage of Swedish aid actors and the debate about global development during &quot;Almedalsveckan&quot;. The coverage will be carried out by a group of young people involved in the non-profit organization FUF, as well as people from the FUF&apos;s office.</narrative>
  </description>
